            "posts": [
                {
                    "body": "Smoothies in South Charlotte that actually taste like fruit, blended fresh at Palm Berries.\n\nWe start every smoothie with real fruit and a cold, thick base, no ice fillers or shortcuts. Pair one with an acai bowl South Charlotte NC regulars love, or grab a smoothie on its own for a quick, refreshing pick-me-up between errands or after a workout.\n\nLocated on Lancaster Highway in the Ballantyne area, we are an easy stop before work, after the gym, or any time you want something that fills you up without the sugar crash that comes with most drive-through options.\n\nOrder online and grab yours today.\n",
                    "timestamp": 1791397800,
                    "link": "https://search.google.com/local/posts?q=Palm+Berries+South+Charlotte&ludocid=9870131471753170069&lpsid=CIHM0ogKEICmqIHSk7Oqag&source=sh/x/loc/post&lsig=AB86z5WPLFvHQ3BqEDmBVbYGGX6X",
                    "image": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMYBmx0g-fm6DDpddu9SeURz7wVFJjfUPVnJq7T=h400-no"
                },
                {
                    "body": "Acai bowls in South Charlotte, blended fresh at Palm Berries, never from a mix.\n\nEvery bowl starts with a thick, cold acai base and gets layered by hand with real fruit, granola, and toppings like nut butter, hemp seeds, and cacao nibs. No shortcuts, no ice fillers, just fruit blended the way it should be, every single time.\n\nWe have become a regular stop for the Ballantyne crowd on Lancaster Highway, from students grabbing breakfast before class to anyone craving a healthy bowl South Charlotte can count on for a real meal that actually holds you over. Build your own bowl from scratch or try one of our signature combinations.\n\nOrder online and pick up your bowl on your schedule.\n",
                    "timestamp": 1790793000,
                    "link": "https://search.google.com/local/posts?q=Palm+Berries+South+Charlotte&ludocid=9870131471753170069&lpsid=CIHM0ogKEMSnpMb084ueKw&source=sh/x/loc/post&lsig=AB86z5WPLFvHQ3BqEDmBVbYGGX6X",
                    "image": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipMoppjCx7t93DpilV6qd2wZM5iQOzPy_BA-2J4c=h400-no"
                },
                {
                    "body": "Looking for an acai shop in South Charlotte? Palm Berries serves fresh bowls daily. Every bowl starts with a smooth acai base, then gets topped with real strawberries, bananas, granola, cacao nibs, and hemp seeds - no shortcuts, no syrupy fillers.\n\nWe keep it simple: fresh fruit, wholesome toppings, and a menu built for busy mornings, post-workout refuels, or an afternoon treat. Stop in before work, after the gym, or anytime you're craving something that actually tastes good for you.\n\nLocally owned and open daily, Palm Berries has become South Charlotte's go-to acai shop. Come taste the difference real ingredients make.\n",
                    "timestamp": 1790160221,
                    "link": "https://search.google.com/local/posts?q=Palm+Berries+South+Charlotte&ludocid=9870131471753170069&lpsid=CIHM0ogKEMPv7oevrc-3pAE&source=sh/x/loc/post&lsig=AB86z5WPLFvHQ3BqEDmBVbYGGX6X",
                    "image": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipPquEBXMilgQsyMYGWKwUXRUvP3tQVBMVemxU3P=h400-no"
                }
